shifting, like making an ePub or audiobook conversion of an existing book, would be allowed. Some people weren't sure if this was intended, though, so I decided I might as well ask. I've got several rather nice ePub editions of Exalted books that it would be nice to be able to publish through the Vault for people who want that kind of thing.<br /> <br /> For that matter, what about Charm compendiums? According to the license, collecting all the Charms in 2e and republishing them in one place complete with errata would also be allowed. Is that intentional?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T13:33:08-07:00","id":1255863,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming the art and resource packs are there so people can use them to do some nicer layout for the content they submit?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T15:21:53-07:00","id":1255915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rand Brittain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1255841#post1255841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm, I'm looking at the rules, and it seems like as written, format shifting, like making an ePub or audiobook conversion of an existing book, would be allowed. Some people weren't sure if this was intended, though, so I decided I might as well ask. I've got several rather nice ePub editions of Exalted books that it would be nice to be able to publish through the Vault for people who want that kind of thing.<br /> <br /> For that matter, what about Charm compendiums? According to the license, collecting all the Charms in 2e and republishing them in one place complete with errata would also be allowed. Is that intentional?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, that is not allowed. The entire point of the community content program is to create new supplemental content, not copy existing works.<br /> <br /> M","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T15:23:18-07:00","id":1255916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1255863#post1255863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm assuming the art and resource packs are there so people can use them to do some nicer layout for the content they submit?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, community content authors can use the templates, art packs, and other Resources for SV Creators to create their PDF supplements. Those resources can only be used for the Storytellers Vault program.<br /> <br /> M","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T16:31:25-07:00","id":1255946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt-M-McElroy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1255916#post1255916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, community content authors can use the templates, art packs, and other Resources for SV Creators to create their PDF supplements. Those resources can only be used for the Storytellers Vault program.<br /> <br /> M</div> </div> </div> </div>If we found art or something we liked and felt was appropriate in one of the other Storytellers Vault areas, would we be allowed to use it in an Exalted work? Like, if we found a good Werewolf picture and wanted to use it for a Lunar?<br /> <br /> The Dungeon Master\u2019s Guild is a separate entity, right? So we can\u2019t use the art and stuff that people have posted for that here, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T16:51:24-07:00","id":1255952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1255946#post1255946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we found art or something we liked and felt was appropriate in one of the other Storytellers Vault areas, would we be allowed to use it in an Exalted work? Like, if we found a good Werewolf picture and wanted to use it for a Lunar?</div> </div> </div> </div>Right now the current rule is Exalted Art can be used for Exalted, WoD Art can be used for WoD, but no crossing the streams. If that changes, we'll update the FAQ and post about it on the Storytellers Vault Facebook page/group.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1255946#post1255946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Dungeon Master\u2019s Guild is a separate entity, right? So we can\u2019t use the art and stuff that people have posted for that here, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is correct. the Art packs released on DMsGuild are owned by Wizards of the Coast and they would not be too happy with someone using their IP for a different company's content.<br /> <br /> M<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T08:16:22-07:00","id":1256103,"title":"","content":"What are the forum rules going to be around self-promotion of released material?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T11:29:13-07:00","id":1256174,"title":"","content":"The content guidelines for Exalted were copy/pasted from WoD in ways that don't make sense.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000956751-Content-Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000956751-Content-Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000956751-Content-Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\"> https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000956751-Content-Guidelines </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> For example:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Fictional locations and made up cities in the modern real world are not allowed. (e.g. Gotham City, Sunnydale, Santa Carla, Derry Maine, etc.) Content creators should do their best to set their products in places that are (or were) real. Products involving otherworldly realms or other mystical places have a leeway to describe those in the same manner found in previous White Wolf publications. Historical settings should make an attempt to utilize real locations to the best of their ability with the understanding that discrepancies will take place. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T12:04:46-07:00","id":1256190,"title":"","content":"Someday I\u2019ll PDF... so many Ideas!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T13:59:27-07:00","id":1256221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AtG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1255816-exalted-storytellers-vault-is-now-open?p=1256174#post1256174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The content guidelines for Exalted were copy/pasted from WoD in ways that don't make sense.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll talk to White Wolf about it.<br /> <br /> M<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T16:17:57-07:00","id":1256263,"title":"","content":"If we have other questions or want to raise an issue about the Exalted Storytellers Vault, is it ok to just keep posting them in this thread or is there another venue that would be preferred?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 20